N5008 [temp.arg.nontype]/2: a reference non-type template argument designates
an object; distinct static objects must produce distinct specializations that
bind distinctly.  Verifies the reference argument's object identity is preserved
(the instance-name suffix comes from the object, not a valuified copy).
assertion.2 FAILURE proves non-vacuity.
